Package: ConScapeRtools
Type: Package
Title: Run ConScape with Large Landscapes from R
Version: 0.4.30
Authors@R: person("Bill", "Peterman", email = "peterman.73@osu.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Prepares, runs, validates, and mosaics randomized shortest-path
    connectivity analyses using the Julia package 'ConScape'. Supports tiled
    processing of landscapes that are too large for a single graph while
    retaining explicit controls for buffer convergence and output reduction.
